{"id":9150267752604,"title":"Venetian Shoe Cream","handle":"venetian-shoe-cream-2","description":"\u003cp\u003eFine oils, gentle cleaners and imported waxes formulated to clean, condition, preserve and polish all smooth leather footwear and articles \u003cbr\u003eNot for use on suede or nubuck leather\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAvailable in five colors: Dark Brown, Black, Cordovan (Burgundy), Tan and Neutral. \u003cbr\u003eColor guide: \u003cbr\u003eDark Brown - Carolina Brown Chromexcel, Dark Brown Mimosa Calf, Espresso Shell Cordovan and all full-grain leather in chocolate, brown or dark brown \u003cbr\u003eBlack - all black full grain leathers \u003cbr\u003eCordovan - works with Burgundy and Color 8 Chromexcel\/Shell Cordovan. Works best with darker reddish brown colors \u003cbr\u003eTan - Amber Calf, Tan Mimosa Calf, all lighter brown \/ tan leather \u003cbr\u003eNeutral - can be used with any color leather\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e*When using colored cream on your Rancourt \u0026amp; Co. footwear please pay attention not to apply cream to light colored stitching thread as it will change the color.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eManufactured by C.A. Zoes in Chicago, IL USA\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2026-07-09T20:18:19-04:00","created_at":"2026-07-09T20:18:19-04:00","vendor":"Rancourt \u0026 Co","type":"Shoe Care","tags":[],"price":1600,"price_min":1600,"price_max":1600,"available":true,"price_varies":false,"compare_at_price":null,"compare_at_price_min":0,"compare_at_price_max":0,"compare_at_price_varies":false,"variants":[{"id":47183910666396,"title":"Neutral","option1":"Neutral","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"VSC001","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":{"id":45887362433180,"product_id":9150267752604,"position":2,"created_at":"2026-07-09T20:18:25-04:00","updated_at":"2026-07-09T20:18:27-04:00","alt":null,"width":800,"height":800,"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0688\/7204\/4700\/files\/VSCneutral.jpg?v=178364270